The appointments table stores information about appointments, including the patient and provider IDs, date, and time.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| id | SERIAL | Unique identifier for the appointment |
| patient_id | INTEGER | Foreign key referencing the patients table |
| date | DATE | Appointment date |
| time | TIME | Appointment time |
| provider_id | INTEGER | Foreign key referencing the providers table |
| scheduler_id | INTEGER | Foreign key referencing the schedulers table |